&control
  calculation='relax', prefix='Cl2_box', outdir='./tmp',
  pseudo_dir='/Volumes/Aditya ssd/Salt-Battery-Lab/tools/pseudo/gbrv', tprnfor=.true., tstress=.true.,
  etot_conv_thr=1e-5, forc_conv_thr=1e-4, disk_io='low'
/
&system
  ibrav=0, nat=2, ntyp=1,
  ecutwfc=50, ecutrho=400, vdw_corr='dft-d3', dftd3_version=4,
  occupations='smearing', smearing='mv', degauss=0.01,
/
&electrons
  conv_thr=1e-09, mixing_beta=0.3, electron_maxstep=200
/
&ions
  ion_dynamics='bfgs'
/
ATOMIC_SPECIES
Cl 35.453 cl_pbe_v1.4.uspp.F.UPF
CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
  12.00000000 0.00000000 0.00000000
  0.00000000 12.50000000 0.00000000
  0.00000000 0.00000000 13.00000000
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
Cl 0.41716667 0.50000000 0.50000000
Cl 0.58283333 0.50000000 0.50000000
K_POINTS automatic
1 1 1 0 0 0
